OL,6,FWarning: This story contains details of
OL,7,Fsexual violence
OL,9,FA woman who was groomed and raped by
OL,10,Fher music teacher as a teenager has
OL,11,Fspoken to the BBC about the abuse she
OL,12,Fkept secret for more than three
OL,13,Fdecades.
OL,15,FShe was 15 when she met Keith Allen, a
OL,16,Fsupply teacher at her school in
OL,17,FBirmingham in the early 1990s.
